{"id":"6a6a94bd7bd292061e7c59f90dbc4049","name":"REMOVE_NPC fires preservation AND post-handler witness memory in one apply()","start":1793815817422,"stop":1793815817423,"duration":1,"status":"passed","fullName":"tests.test_effect_applier_memory_preservation#test_remove_npc_propagates_hearsay_alongside_post_handler_witness_memory","historyId":"f7894927da56ff22451e551c1a04f450.d41d8cd98f00b204e9800998ecf8427e","flaky":false,"muted":false,"known":false,"isRetry":false,"labels":[{"name":"epic","value":"Game Timeline"},{"name":"feature","value":"Effect application"},{"name":"story","value":"Remove NPC"},{"name":"parentSuite","value":"tests"},{"name":"suite","value":"test_effect_applier_memory_preservation"},{"name":"host","value":"runnervm7aw5e"},{"name":"thread","value":"2307-MainThread"},{"name":"framework","value":"pytest"},{"name":"language","value":"cpython3"},{"name":"package","value":"tests.test_effect_applier_memory_preservation"}],"groupedLabels":{"epic":["Game Timeline"],"feature":["Effect application"],"story":["Remove NPC"],"parentSuite":["tests"],"suite":["test_effect_applier_memory_preservation"],"host":["runnervm7aw5e"],"thread":["2307-MainThread"],"framework":["pytest"],"language":["cpython3"],"package":["tests.test_effect_applier_memory_preservation"]},"parameters":[],"links":[],"steps":[],"error":{},"testCase":{"id":"f7894927da56ff22451e551c1a04f450","externalId":"b654f41910276404daa46091c9e72a3f","name":"REMOVE_NPC fires preservation AND post-handler witness memory in one apply()","fullName":"tests.test_effect_applier_memory_preservation#test_remove_npc_propagates_hearsay_alongside_post_handler_witness_memory"},"descriptionHtml":"<p>Co-located NPC must witness the removal directly while distant NPCs hear about it.</p>\n<pre><code>Locks in the ordering invariant: preservation runs BEFORE the\nmutation (so same-city non-witnesses get hearsay of the victim's\nprior memory) and ``emit_memory`` fires AFTER the mutation (so a\nco-located witness gets a fresh ``&quot;... is no longer here&quot;``\nPERSONAL_EXPERIENCE node). A future refactor that moves the\npreservation call below the mutation would silently lose the\nhearsay; this test catches that.\n</code></pre>\n","environment":"default","setup":[{"id":"5f970ada2d2df19140cc42c4cdbcdea3","type":"before","name":"event_loop_policy","status":"passed","steps":[],"duration":1},{"id":"19957613bd7dd4dd677ccf513cb22410","type":"before","name":"_install_log_scrubber","status":"passed","steps":[],"duration":0}],"teardown":[{"id":"ad9818a70f0a0321e5c474ac424ac479","type":"after","name":"_install_log_scrubber::0","status":"passed","steps":[],"duration":0}],"history":[],"retries":[],"breadcrumbs":[["tests","test_effect_applier_memory_preservation"]],"retry":false,"titlePath":["tests","test_effect_applier_memory_preservation.py"],"retriesCount":0,"attachments":[],"order":1122,"categories":[]}